than just a regular Coca-Cola.
普通的装瓶可口可乐还要受欢迎。

914
00:44:25.140 --> 00:44:32.860
So popular, in fact, that my grandfather wrote a letter to the Coca-Cola company telling
事实上，受欢迎到我外公专门给可口可乐公司写了一封信，

915
