I know.
我知道。

1011
00:48:57.240 --> 00:48:58.220
Bonjour, Layla.
你好，莱拉。

1012
00:48:58.220 --> 00:49:04.180
Layla says, comedy actors always talk about how difficult it is to stay serious in scenes,
莱拉说，喜剧演员总是谈论在拍戏时保持严肃有多么困难，

