This is such a good question because, you know, we spent nine years on the office and a lot of life
这是一个非常好的问题，因为，你知道的，我们在《办公室》度过了九年，在九年的时间里发生了

1018
00:49:22.820 --> 00:49:24.500
happens to you in nine years.
