We have lots of great behind-the-scenes pictures that I'll put in stories of our time on the set.
我们有很多精彩的幕后照片，我会把它们发到我们片场时光的快拍里。

1110
00:54:19.380 --> 00:54:21.100
Emily, thank you for that suggestion.
艾米丽，谢谢你的建议。

1111
00:54:21.600 --> 00:54:23.480
